cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Citation metadata for the TabFM ensemble modeling and interpretation software."
type: software
title: "TabFM Ensemble for Flight Difficulty Classification and Landing Performance Prediction in Virtual Reality"
version: 1.0.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/mfekrouni-spec/TabFM-Ensemble-for-Flight-Difficulty-Landing-Performance-in-VR"
url: "https://github.com/mfekrouni-spec/TabFM-Ensemble-for-Flight-Difficulty-Landing-Performance-in-VR"
abstract: >-
  Research code for five-fold cross-validation of a 32-member TabFM
  ensemble and XGBoost, random forest, and k-nearest-neighbor baselines for
  flight-difficulty classification and landing-performance regression, with
  direct permutation SHAP, constrained language-model summaries, and a local
  graphical review application.
